  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Culture, empowerment and advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marginalized populations such as the LGBTQ+ community in Paraguay often suffer discrimination, human rights violations, and social exclusion. The IAF supports community-led solutions to protecting human rights and promoting non-discrimination. IAF grantee partner Aireana will raise awareness of LGBTQ+ human rights in Paraguay, promote social inclusion, and reduce violence and discrimination. Aireana will carry out a series of events and dialogues across vulnerable populations, including farmers, young people, and Indigenous people.</narrative>
  </description>
